From: Deniz Kokden <koekdendeniz@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] build: allow the gtelwifi composer to use display-info

The device-specific composer reuses the drm_hwcomposer defaults and needs
the same static display-info dependency. Limit visibility to that module path.

Assisted-by: GPT-6 (Codex)
---
diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 17caed6..723f0a6 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -52,6 +52,7 @@ cc_library_static {
     visibility: [
         ":__subpackages__",
         "//external/drm_hwcomposer:__subpackages__",
+        "//device/samsung/gtelwifi/composer",
         "//device/amlogic/yukawa/hal/gralloc",
         "//device/linaro:__subpackages__",
         "//vendor:__subpackages__",
